<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-ALL YIELDS HIGHER AT T-BILL AUCTION.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-ALL YIELDS HIGHER AT T-BILL AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield of all</p>
<p>maturities of Latvian T-bills rose at auction on Wednesday, the</p>
<p>finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD(pct) LAST WEEK NO OF BANKS ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> One month    4.49	  4.09	 2	   0.75  0.95   0.75</p>
<p> Three-month  5.86	  5.78	 6	   1.50  3.10   1.50</p>
<p> Six-month    6.62	  6.34	 8	   2.0   5.15   2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
